%%label IV. Largo – Allegro – Largo
%%note G. A chorale for winds and brass frames a fast movement on an ostinato; the symphony ends quietly on the chorale.
X:1
T:Stravinsky’s Missing Symphony
T:IV. Largo – Allegro – Largo
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Igor Stravinsky
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Largo" 1/4=50
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tpt tbn] timp pno [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
